{"4896610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DISREPAIR — A Tale Beyond Half-Life", "steam_appid": 4896610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>DISREPAIR</strong></i> is an <i>atmospheric puzzle horror total conversion mod</i> for <strong>Half-Life 2</strong>, set in the aftermath of the Black Mesa disaster and the devastating 7-Hour War.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <i><strong>Nathan Heimann</strong></i>, a lone Combine hazmat photographer deployed into the radioactive ruins of <strong>Black Mesa</strong> after reports emerge of anomalies buried deep within the abandoned office complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with nothing but a camera and standard-issue equipment, your objective is simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENTER. DOCUMENT. RETURN.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the deeper you descend into the decaying facility, the more reality begins to unravel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore collapsing corridors, solve environmental puzzles, uncover fragments of a long forgotten past, and confront whatever still remains beneath Black Mesa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some places should stay buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But some memories should never stay lost.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>FEATURES</strong></i> </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original atmospheric soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique and unsettling visual style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced original performances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lore-rich environments with hidden details</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand-new campaign set beneath Black Mesa</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><